{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13001","headline":"詶常郿县见赠 · 独孤及","name":"詶常郿县见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱君修政若修身，鳏寡来归乳雉驯。\n堂上五弦销暇日，邑中千室有阳春。\n谓乘凫舄朝天子，却愧猪肝累主人。\n辞後读君怀县作，定知三岁字犹新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}